OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mostly cloudy day
OL,6,Fwith scattered showers. Showers may
OL,7,Fturn heavy at times with a risk of
OL,8,Fhail and thunder. Light winds will
OL,9,Ffreshen a little during the showers.
OL,10,FTemperatures slightly below the
OL,11,Fseasonal average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FIt will remain rather cloudy
OL,14,Fthrough the evening and overnight with
OL,15,Ffurther showers, some perhaps turning
OL,16,Fheavy and thundery, giving some
OL,17,Fsurface water issues. A cool night to
OL,18,Fcome.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,165,160,301,260,100,100
