OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FThe heaviest of the showers
OL,6,Fwill move away to the south on
OL,7,FThursday morning. However, staying
OL,8,Ffairly cloudy with further lighter
OL,9,Fshowers feeding in from the north.
OL,10,FFresher than Wednesday.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:
OL,13,FTemperatures staying below average
OL,14,Finto the weekend. Isolated showers
OL,15,Fcontinuing but becoming more settled
OL,16,Fagain by Sunday with sunny spells
OL,17,Fthroughout.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
